873
00:51:14,775 --> 00:51:15,135
Kadir.

874
00:51:15,515 --> 00:51:16,085
Alô, irmão.

875
00:51:16,565 --> 00:51:17,665
Um segundo.

876
00:51:18,275 --> 00:51:19,565
Toma, toma, toma.

877
00:51:19,645 --> 00:51:20,465
Papai.

878
00:51:20,665 --> 00:51:23,485
