[Médico]: Fique aqui.

1414
01:34:58,900 --> 01:35:00,140
[Médico]: Preparem a adrenalina.

1415
01:35:00,220 --> 01:35:01,330
[Médico]: Afastem-se.

1416
01:35:01,410 --> 01:35:02,330
